stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> draft: drafter saves a new draft<br/>(changes composed in browser,<br/>records base_rev)
    draft --> draft: drafter updates the draft<br/>(replaces changes, notes, base_rev)
    draft --> discarded: drafter discards
    draft --> conflict: publish attempted, but a newer<br/>revision touched the same nodes
    conflict --> draft: drafter updates against<br/>latest revision
    draft --> published: approver publishes<br/>(checks re-run; atomic → TREE_REVISION r+1)
    published --> [*]
    discarded --> [*]

    note left of published
        publish is blocked only by structural errors:
        cycle, deprecated or foreign parent,
        deprecate with children,
        non-machine-safe label, stale base_rev.
        WoRMS issues are warnings.
        Published changesets can't be edited.
    end note
